      ],
      "text": "Without focal findings, one suggested panel:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " chest x-ray, urinalysis, CBC with differential, ESR or CRP, HIV test, serum chemistries (electrolytes, calcium, liver and renal tests) and TSH."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
